@startuml
actor "External Reviewer" as Reviewer
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Review API" as API
participant "Assignment Guard" as Guard
participant "External Grant Guard" as Grant
participant PostgreSQL as DB

Reviewer -> UI: Open assigned task or record finding
UI -> API: Request with active session and task ID
API -> Guard: Verify tenant, role and exact assigned_user_id
Guard -> DB: Load task and cycle
Guard -> Grant: Validate grant for requested action and resources
Grant -> DB: Read status, start, expiry, actions and scope
alt valid grant and exact resource match
  Grant --> Guard: Permit
  Guard --> API: Permit
  API --> UI: Return assigned review data
else expired, revoked, wrong action or wrong resource
  Grant --> Guard: Deny
  Guard --> API: 403 without resource disclosure
  API --> UI: Access unavailable
end
@enduml
